---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Shipping & Delivery Policy | Aju House">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 md:py-24">
        
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-8">
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">Home</a>
            <span>/</span>
            <span class="text-gray-900">Shipping Policy</span>
        </nav>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-8">Shipping & Delivery Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-12 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">Pan-India Express Dispatch</p>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
            
            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">1. Order Processing Time</h2>
                <p>All orders placed on <code>ajuperfumes.com</code> are processed and packaged within <strong>24 to 48 business hours</strong> (excluding Sundays and national holidays).</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">2. Delivery Partners & Timelines</h2>
                <p>We partner primarily with <strong>DTDC Courier</strong> and leading express courier networks to ensure safe delivery across India:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-600">
                    <li><strong>Metro Cities:</strong> 2 to 4 business days post-dispatch.</li>
                    <li><strong>Rest of India:</strong> 4 to 7 business days post-dispatch.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">3. Shipping Charges</h2>
                <p>We provide <strong>Complimentary (Free) Standard Shipping</strong> on all prepaid orders placed across India.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">4. Shipment Tracking</h2>
                <p>Once your parcel is dispatched, a tracking reference number will be sent to your registered email address and updated inside your <a href="/account" class="text-black font-semibold underline">Account Dashboard</a>.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">5. Contact Support</h2>
                <p>For urgent dispatch inquiries or address changes before shipping:</p>
                <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-sm text-xs space-y-1 font-mono">
                    <p class="font-bold text-gray-900">Logistics Concierge</p>
                    <p>WhatsApp: +91 8075304432</p>
                    <p>Email: perfumesaju@gmail.com</p>
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>